  (text
    "IP101GRI: PHY 地址 0x00 (AD0/AD3 下拉); REF_CLK 由 PHY 输出给 MAC (use_ephy25m=0)"
    (at 20.32 260.35 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
  )
  (text
    "LCSC 勘误(2026-09 复核): IP101GRI=C910373 而非 C50326; HR911105A=C12074 而非 C7633; ADUM1201=C9669 而非 C25226; MAX3232=C15846 而非 C5757; MAX3485=C18148 而非 C7593; B0505S=C512032 而非 C83467; 详见 out/README.md"
    (at 20.32 270.51 0.0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27)
      )
      (justify left bottom)
    )
